  nodeId: Taking Control
  speakerName: 
  lineText: "<b>ACT 1</b>\r\n<b>Location:</b> <i>Outside the Marcus Art Gallery.
    Cold, dreary palette. Flashing blue police lights. Detective Miller is waiting
    by the yellow tape.</i>\r\n\r\n<b>Detective Miller:</b>\r\n\"Glad you made it.
    Oversight wasn't kidding when they said they were pairing us up. We need to move
    fast.\"\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r"
